  "title": "AudioCodes Voca Conversational Interaction Center Now Offers Omnichannel",
  "summary": "AudioCodes, a leading vendor of advanced communications software, products and productivity solutions for the digital workplace and customer experience, today announced that Voca Conversational Interaction Center (Voca CIC) is now an omnichannel contact center for Microsoft Teams, adding email and webchat to the existing voice experience.",
